      "start_seconds": 120.03,
      "end_seconds": 134.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.87,
      "text": "oh, I take metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. Sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed so, before this I was on glimepiride; that's been stopped"
    },
    {
